  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tbsp olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat until shimmering.",
    "Add minced garlic and sauté for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Add chicken livers, season with salt, pepper, cumin, oregano, and cook 5-6 minutes, turning until browned.",
    "Drizzle lime juice over livers, reduce heat to low, and simmer for 10 minutes until tender.",
    "Heat corn tortillas on a dry skillet 30 seconds each side.",
    "Shape a small mound of liver on the center of each tortilla like nigiri.",
    "Top each mound with red onion, cilantro, and shredded cabbage.",
    "Serve immediately, optionally with fresh lime juice or hot sauce."
  ],
